WEBVTT

00:05:58.645 --> 00:06:02.042
and that means there's always
a loser in baseball.

00:06:02.066 --> 00:06:03.698
But what about pizza?

00:06:03.722 --> 00:06:05.909
Well, in pizza, we're not really --

00:06:05.933 --> 00:06:09.576
there's no winning. How do you win pizza?

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:12.831
You don't. But you do look for,

00:06:12.855 --> 00:06:14.552
"Are we satisfied?"

00:06:14.576 --> 00:06:16.624
And sometimes that can
be different amounts

00:06:16.648 --> 00:06:18.791
over different times
or with different people

00:06:18.815 --> 00:06:20.708
or on different days.

00:06:20.732 --> 00:06:23.838
And we get to decide
when we feel satisfied.

00:06:23.862 --> 00:06:26.676
If we're still hungry,
we might have some more.

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:28.214
If you eat too much, though,

00:06:28.238 --> 00:06:30.119
you just feel gross.